    }
  },
  "translations": [
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_cyrus#CopScr.life-cyrus.000.0003",
      "source_sha256": "271147ccd8735917",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 15,
      "text": "A vision was revealed to him, saying, “Get up and go toward the ocean.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_cyrus#CopScr.life-cyrus.000.0008",
      "source_sha256": "b3f5740b9142e69b",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 15,
      "text": "He stood up and knocked at the door for an hour, to no avail."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_cyrus#CopScr.life-cyrus.000.0040",
      "source_sha256": "20feeb5217aa39bb",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 15,
      "text": "He said to me, “Yes, there is someone there whose single sandal strap the whole world is not worthy of.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_cyrus#CopScr.life-cyrus.000.0064",
      "source_sha256": "b4a08fdc5a002062",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 15,
      "text": "But I could not receive him, because he is the king’s son."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_cyrus#CopScr.life-cyrus.001.0028",
      "source_sha256": "7f834f24ec8a54c1",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 15,
      "text": "He said to me again, “My beloved brother Pambo, I am ill today. Do me the kindness of praying for me until I pass along the road of fear and trembling.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_cyrus#CopScr.life-cyrus.001.0029",
      "source_sha256": "d3ade7d1be0d074f",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 15,
      "text": "I said to him, “My beloved father, are you too afraid, after all the ascetic disciplines you have endured in the world?”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_cyrus#CopScr.life-cyrus.001.0030",
      "source_sha256": "6aae3aa377078e8d",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 15,
      "text": "He said to me, “As for ascetic disciplines, I performed a few in accordance with what God appointed for me. But why should we not be afraid, since we have been shown through many testimonies that a river of fire flows before the Judge?”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_cyrus#CopScr.life-cyrus.001.0031",
      "source_sha256": "ad38495f1993a6d5",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 15,
      "text": "“And everyone must cross that river, whether righteous or sinful. You should pray for me until I pass along that fearful road.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_cyrus#CopScr.life-cyrus.001.0032",
      "source_sha256": "26b93ea49f840673",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 15,
      "text": "He also says, “Even if a person’s life on earth is only one day, he is not free from sin,” and again, “All flesh will be salted with fire.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_cyrus#CopScr.life-cyrus.001.0038",
      "source_sha256": "8aaa57bd7bc82f29",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 15,
      "text": "One of them came toward me; he was a [?]."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_cyrus#CopScr.life-cyrus.001.0047",
      "source_sha256": "1e1645719a8c8673",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 15,
      "text": "The Savior stretched out his hand over the doorway of the lodging."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_cyrus#CopScr.life-cyrus.001.0048",
      "source_sha256": "23c52ccc0bf2126d",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 15,
      "text": "He wove over the body of the blessed man."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_cyrus#CopScr.life-cyrus.001.0049",
      "source_sha256": "2f5e0966449006e4",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 15,
      "text": "It became a shelter for him until the day of true judgment."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_cyrus#CopScr.life-cyrus.001.0050",
      "source_sha256": "5a2961d6aa1c59e9",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 15,
      "text": "The Savior went up to heaven with his angels."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_cyrus#CopScr.life-cyrus.001.0051",
      "source_sha256": "f229e5a880b803c8",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 15,
      "text": "As for me, I went out to the brothers, Apa Pamun and Apa Hierax. I told them what I had seen, and they gave glory to God."
    }
  ]
}
